      "handle": "shires-halloween-sprinkle-cookies-120-count",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>PRE-ORDER YOUR HALLOWEEN COOKIES !! </strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><em>*Available to ship beginning October 8th*</em></span></strong></p>\n<p>Nut-Free, PPM 150, and can be served occasionally! </p>\n<p><strong>Ingredients: </strong>Enriched flour, liquid whole egg, white sugar, brown sugar, corn syrup, non-hydrogenated margarine (liquid canola oil, water, modified palm and palm kernel oils, salt, whey powder, mono and diglycerides, soya lecithin, sodium benzoate, artificial flavour, citric acid, vitamin A palmitate, Vitamin D3), shape  sprinkles (icing sugar, modified corn starch, palm kernel oil, cornstarch, confectioners glaze, flavor, soya lecithin, gum arabic, F D &amp; C artificial colour, Red # 40dye, Yellow # 6 dye, Yellow #5 dye , Blue # 1 dye),  polysorbate 60, inulin, cellulose gum, guar gum, xanthan gum, Sodium Bicarbonate, liquid sugar,  baking powder</p>\n<p><strong>Case Pack: </strong>120 x Individually Wrapped Cookies. Sold by the Case.</p>\n<!---->",
