      "title": "Sub on 3\" bun",
      "handle": "turkey-sub-on-whole-wheat-bun",
      "body_html": "<p>Your choice of turkey, chicken Caesar, tuna or egg salad. </p>\n<p><em><strong>TURKEY SUB</strong> <strong class=\"x-el x-el-span c1-1o c1-1p c1-b c1-7g c1-5r c1-7h c1-7i\">Ingredients:<span> </span></strong></em><span class=\"x-el x-el-span c1-1o c1-1p c1-b c1-7g c1-5r c1-7h c1-7i\">turkey slices, mayo, yellow cheese on a white bun. </span></p>\n<p><em><strong><span class=\"x-el x-el-span c1-1o c1-1p c1-b c1-7g c1-5r c1-7h c1-7i\">CHICKEN CAESAR SUB Ingredients: </span></strong></em><span class=\"x-el x-el-span c1-1o c1-1p c1-b c1-7g c1-5r c1-7h c1-7i\"> chicken, Caesar dressing on a white bun.</span></p>\n<p><em><strong><span class=\"x-el x-el-span c1-1o c1-1p c1-b c1-7g c1-5r c1-7h c1-7i\">TUNA SUB Ingredients: </span></strong></em><span class=\"x-el x-el-span c1-1o c1-1p c1-b c1-7g c1-5r c1-7h c1-7i\">tuna, mayo, onion, celery on a white bun.</span></p>\n<p><em><strong><span class=\"x-el x-el-span c1-1o c1-1p c1-b c1-7g c1-5r c1-7h c1-7i\">EGG SALAD SUB Ingredients: </span></strong></em><span class=\"x-el x-el-span c1-1o c1-1p c1-b c1-7g c1-5r c1-7h c1-7i\">egg, mayo, onion, celery, yellow cheese on a white bun.</span></p>\n<p>Sold Individually. Individually Wrapped. <em><strong>Wraps are delivered on Tuesday's and must be consumed by Friday of the same week.</strong></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><em><strong>Orders must be placed by Thursday at 10:00 for delivery on the following Tuesday.</strong></em></span></p>",
